menu "UPS to ESP32 Module fleet heartbeat"

config UPSA_FLEET_URL
    string "Fleet heartbeat endpoint (Supabase project URL)"
    default ""
    help
        The Supabase project URL, e.g. https://abcd.supabase.co. The board
        calls its heartbeat() function there. Empty: the heartbeat is built
        in but never sends, and the page says it is not configured.

config UPSA_FLEET_KEY
    string "Fleet heartbeat public key"
    default ""
    help
        The project's PUBLIC (anon / publishable) key. It ships in open-source
        firmware, so it must only be able to call heartbeat(): see
        telemetry/supabase.sql. Never the service_role key.

endmenu
